mary&lt;br&gt;confidence 0–100 (descriptive only)&lt;br&gt;SC: PF vote share&lt;br&gt;DEB: round positions, concessions, position bias&lt;br&gt;cost log: calls, tokens, latency" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1972" y="92" width="296" height="254" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="parse" value="One deterministic repair parse; an output still invalid is scored TF (sensitivity analysis: excluded). Baselines emit the label field only." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1972" y="362" width="296" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="eFG1" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=10;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeWidth=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.55;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="deb" target="out"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1950" y="234"/><mxPoint x="1950" y="232"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="eFG2" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=10;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeWidth=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.88;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="grpB" target="out"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1458" y="392"/><mxPoint x="1950" y="392"/><mxPoint x="1950" y="316"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="eFG3" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=10;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeWidth=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.88;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="grpS" target="out"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1608" y="392"/><mxPoint x="1950" y="392"/><mxPoint x="1950" y="316"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="eFG4" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=10;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="out" target="parse"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="secB" value="B  Sealed ground-truth channel: derived from execution only; no triage method can read it" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=2.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="340" y="665" width="670" height="262" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sig" value="&lt;b&gt;Failure signature&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;σ(t, V) = (outcome type, exception class, failing test line); deterministic over 3 runs" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=2.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="352" y="700" width="196" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rule" value="&lt;b&gt;PF&lt;/b&gt;: fails on B, passes on F&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;TF&lt;/b&gt;: fails on B and F, σ&lt;sub&gt;B&lt;/sub&gt; = σ&lt;sub&gt;F&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;AMB&lt;/b&gt;: both fail, σ&lt;sub&gt;B&lt;/sub&gt; ≠ σ&lt;sub&gt;F&lt;/sub&gt; (sensitivity only)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Excluded&lt;/b&gt;: FLAKY, TIMEOUT, ENV, NC&lt;br&gt;passes on B: not a triage instance" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=2.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="700" width="214" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="samp" value="&lt;b&gt;Evaluation sample&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;all PF; 2 TF per PF over the split, project-stratified (IPW weights)&lt;br&gt;D1-test: 60 PF / 120 TF / 13 AMB → 177 scored at S1&lt;br&gt;D2: 300 judged, 270 scored" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=2.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="786" y="700" width="212" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="store" value="&lt;b&gt;Sealed label store&lt;/b&gt;: written before any judge runs; not readable by any judging module; joined to predictions only at evaluation" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=2.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="352" y="838" width="646" height="74" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="eB0" value="outcomes of every run on B and F" style="rounded=0;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=10;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeWidth=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="frec" target="sig"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="505" y="655"/><mxPoint x="333" y="655"/><mxPoint x="333" y="760"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="eB1" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=10;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="sig" target="rule"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="eB2" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=10;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="rule" target="samp"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="eB3" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=10;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeWidth=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="rule" target="store"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="eB4" value="instance ids only" style="rounded=0;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=10;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 2;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="samp" target="p7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1020" y="760"/><mxPoint x="1020" y="655"/><mxPoint x="850" y="655"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="secH" value="H  Evaluation against the sealed labels" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1380" y="665" width="900" height="262" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="score" value="&lt;b&gt;Scoring&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;unit: one failing test&lt;br&gt;metrics per replicate, averaged over replicates&lt;br&gt;resampling unit: bug&lt;br&gt;AMB and leakage-aborted instances excluded" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1392" y="700" width="190" height="212" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="metrics" value="&lt;b&gt;Metrics&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;precision, recall, F1 of the PF class · FPR, FNR · MCC&lt;br&gt;TPR, TNR, balanced accuracy · confusion matrix&lt;br&gt;PF tests lost · bug-level retention&lt;br&gt;precision at the natural prevalence (IPW)&lt;br&gt;PR-AUC of the SC vote share · invalid-output rate&lt;br&gt;calls, tokens, latency · ΔF1 per 1,000 tokens vs J1&lt;br&gt;FP / FN error analysis" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1594" y="700" width="330" height="212" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="stats" value="&lt;b&gt;Statistics&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;bug-level cluster bootstrap, 10,000 resamples, paired&lt;br&gt;Holm over H1–H3b (F1); recall, precision: secondary family&lt;br&gt;equivalence: 90% CI within ±0.05 F1&lt;br&gt;sensitivity: McNemar exact, per-project Wilcoxon, leave-one-project-out&lt;br&gt;E2 only: logistic mixed model (exploratory)" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1936" y="700" width="332" height="212" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="eGH" value="predictions" style="rounded=0;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=10;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeWidth=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.2;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="parse" target="score"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="2120" y="655"/><mxPoint x="1370" y="655"/><mxPoint x="1370" y="742"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="eBH" value="sealed labels (evaluation only)" style="rounded=0;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=10;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.82;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="store" target="score"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="eH1" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=10;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="score" target="metrics"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="eH2" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=10;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="metrics" target="stats"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="secI" value="I  Experimental design" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="945" width="740" height="615" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e1" value="&lt;b&gt;E1 · Baselines and arms&lt;/b&gt;: DA, KA, R0, J1, SC, SC-T, DEB at S1 · D1-test · judge M1 · 3 replicates → &lt;b&gt;H1&lt;/b&gt; J1 vs R0" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.75;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="32" y="982" width="716" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e2" value="&lt;b&gt;E2 · Specification availability&lt;/b&gt;: S0 / S1 / S2 × J1, SC, DEB · D1-test · 3 replicates → &lt;b&gt;H2a&lt;/b&gt; S1 vs S0 (methods with Javadoc), &lt;b&gt;H2b&lt;/b&gt; S2 vs S1" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.75;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="32" y="1054" width="716" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e3" value="&lt;b&gt;E3 · Equal-budget architectures&lt;/b&gt;: J1, SC, SC-T, DEB at S1 with cost and latency → &lt;b&gt;H3a&lt;/b&gt; DEB vs SC, &lt;b&gt;H3b&lt;/b&gt; SC vs J1" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.75;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="32" y="1126" width="716" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e4" value="&lt;b&gt;E4 · Ablations&lt;/b&gt; (one replicate; each against its parent arm on identical instances)&lt;br&gt;A1  DEB without argument exchange in round 2&lt;br&gt;A2  DEB with neutral instead of adversarial debaters&lt;br&gt;A3  SC decision threshold v ≥ 2/5 and v ≥ 4/5 (re-analysis, no calls)&lt;br&gt;A4  failure evidence [F] removed (J1, SC, DEB)&lt;br&gt;A5a buggy focal body shown (J1, DEB) · A5b body-derived specification (J1 at S2)" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 3 2 3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="32" y="1198" width="716" height="152" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e5" value="&lt;b&gt;E5 · Robustness&lt;/b&gt; (one replicate)&lt;br&gt;D2 seeded faults: all arms and specification levels, judge M1&lt;br&gt;second judge M2, Gemma 4 12B: J1, SC, DEB at S1 on D1-test and D2&lt;br&gt;per-project F1, Wilcoxon over projects, leave-one-project-out&lt;br&gt;further judges: Qwen3.5 35B, Ministral 3 14B (M3), three-family vote; frontier reference Claude Sonnet 5.5" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 3 2 3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="32" y="1360" width="716" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="noteI" value="Confirmatory family: H1, H2a, H2b, H3a, H3b (Holm). Configuration, prompts and decoding frozen in one file before any held-out call. E2, E3 and E4 vary only the components tagged in sections E and F." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="32" y="1500" width="716" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="secJ" value="J  Supplementary analyses, grouped by evidential status" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="780" y="945" width="740" height="615" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="kuu" value="&lt;b&gt;Judge-only rules (RQ4)&lt;/b&gt; · hypotheses fixed in advance in the decision log, tested on D2; post hoc on D1&lt;br&gt;KUU (baseline): one J1 vote from each of three families, M1 Qwen3.5 9B, M2 Gemma 4 12B, M3 Ministral 3 14B; discard only on unanimous TF; an invalid vote keeps the test&lt;br&gt;cascade: disagreements escalated to a frontier judge&#x27;s DEB · KUU-NG: Llama 3.1 8B replaces M2" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="792" y="982" width="716" height="132" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pilot" value="&lt;b&gt;Mutation probes, pilot&lt;/b&gt; · exploratory (D1-test, labels known)&lt;br&gt;up to 80 first-order mutants of the method under test and its same-class callees (ROR, AOR, COR, LVR, NEG, STD); each run FLIP, SHIFT, SAME or ERR&lt;br&gt;flip: some mutant makes the test pass · decoupled: ≥ 10 mutants compiled, none changes the failure" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 3 2 3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="792" y="1126" width="716" height="112" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="conf" value="&lt;b&gt;Registered confirmation, OSF kp79c&lt;/b&gt; · confirmatory, registered before its data existed&lt;br&gt;fresh failing tests from bugs never used before: frames F1, F2 and control group CTRL&lt;br&gt;C1  flip rate, PF − TF · C2  decoupled rate, TF − PF&lt;br&gt;C3  balanced accuracy, KUU + decoupled-discard − KUU&lt;br&gt;C4  PF tests lost, 2-of-3 vote + keep certificate − 2-of-3 vote&lt;br&gt;one Holm family, α = 0.05 · bug-level bootstrap · exact bound on bug loss" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.75;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="792" y="1250" width="716" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="wdp" value="&lt;b&gt;Whole-method dependence probes&lt;/b&gt; · exploratory, retrospective, not externally preregistered&lt;br&gt;method body replaced by entry-recording throwing and fixed-return bodies; level U = no entry observed and throw-invariant; rule KUU + CD-U" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 3 2 3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="792" y="1422" width="716" height="86" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="noteJ" value="Probes execute the buggy version only; they use no LLM, no labels and no fixed version." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="792" y="1516" width="716" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="secK" value="K  Research questions, hypotheses and findings" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1540" y="945" width="740" height="615" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rq1" value="&lt;b&gt;RQ1 · Accuracy and tests lost&lt;/b&gt; (H1): inconclusive after Holm; best arm DEB F1 0.511 vs keep-all 0.506, MCC 0.267; DEB discards 30 of 60 bug-revealing tests" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1552" y="982" width="716" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rq2" value="&lt;b&gt;RQ2 · Specification effect&lt;/b&gt; (H2a, H2b): no detectable gain from Javadoc or an inferred specification; both inconclusive" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1552" y="1054" width="716" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rq3" value="&lt;b&gt;RQ3 · Architecture effect&lt;/b&gt; (H3a, H3b): DEB − SC +0.074 F1, Holm p 0.532; SC − J1 −0.024; inconclusive" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1552" y="1110" width="716" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rq4" value="&lt;b&gt;RQ4 · Judge-only rules&lt;/b&gt;: one trade-off curve; KUU lost 4 of 154 bug-revealing tests on D2 vs DEB&#x27;s 56; MCC below DEB" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1552" y="1166" width="716" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rq5" value="&lt;b&gt;RQ5 · Mutation outcomes&lt;/b&gt; (C1, C2): C1 not supported (+0.028 [−0.137, 0.274]); C2 supported (+0.243 [0.114, 0.372], Holm p 0.0024), in one frame and mostly two projects" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1552" y="1222" width="716" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rq6" value="&lt;b&gt;RQ6 · Certificate rules&lt;/b&gt; (C3, C4): both inconclusive; KUU + decoupled-discard lost one bug" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1552" y="1294" width="716" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rqx" value="&lt;b&gt;Exploratory&lt;/b&gt;: whole-method check raised TNR by +0.104 [0.037, 0.201] over KUU, no bug lost; retrospective, concentrated" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1552" y="1350" width="716" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="eff" value="&lt;b&gt;Efficiency&lt;/b&gt;: DEB 9,188 vs SC 9,551 tokens per failure; 13.3 s vs 8.1 s latency (sequential calls)" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;rounded=0;shadow=0;glass=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1552" y="1406" width="716" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lim" value="&lt;b&gt;Limitations&lt;/b&gt;: one benchmark, language and generator; small local judges below their development gate; 22 and 21 bugs with a bug-revealing test (D1-test, confirmation)" styl